job-name-anomaly = Anomaly
job-description-anomaly = You are an unknownable force from the Noosephere. You have manifested a mortal coil to observe and experience True Space.

trait-anomalyJaunt-name = Jaunt
trait-anomalyJaunt-desc = Force your body back into the Noosephere to traverse True Space unhindered.

trait-anomalySmoke-name = Smoke Screen
trait-anomalySmoke-desc = Kick up psionic dust that can disrupt vision.

trait-anomalyInvisible-name = Photonic-Phase
trait-anomalyInvisible-desc = Force visible light to change as it reflects off of you. Those who are attuned to the Noosphere will lose sight of you.
